      "content": "thanks for letting me know. i don't have any tylenol or advil at my house though, only the aspirin. i'm really worried because he's so uncomfortable and i can't get ahold of his doctor right now since it's late. is there any way i could just give him a small dose of the aspirin to help him get through the night? like maybe just a half a pill or something? i just want him to be able to rest.",
